\] Thus, $(b-d)^2 = (b+d)^2-4bd = 8$. So, $b-d = 2\sqrt{2}$ or $d-b = 2\sqrt{2}$.然后我们选择$b-d = 2\sqrt{2}$，因为(Collision - checkout in Chinese)\] This means $\alpha_1\alpha_2=2-b=-d$.
